{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"42":"Model Behavior of the Prophet (Kitab Al-Sunnah)"},"section_detail":{"42":{"hadithnumber_first":4596,"hadithnumber_last":4772,"arabicnumber_first":4596,"arabicnumber_last":4772,"name_native":"كتاب السنة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4623,"arabicnumber":4623,"text":"حدثنا ابن المثنى، ان يحيى بن كثير العنبري، حدثهم قال كان قرة بن خالد يقول لنا يا فتيان لا تغلبوا على الحسن فانه كان رايه السنة والصواب","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih Lighairihi"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":42,"hadith":28}}]}